(EMPLOYMENT AGREEMENT \(VERSION A\)) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (This Employment Agreement \("Agreement"\) is entered into as of October 15, 2024,) Tj
T* (by and between Novacorp Solutions Private Limited \("Employer"\), a fictional) Tj
T* (software enterprise, and Priya Sen \("Employee"\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. POSITION AND DUTIES) Tj
T* (Employee shall serve in the full-time role of Senior Frontend Engineer,) Tj
T* (reporting to the Director of Engineering, and shall perform software) Tj
T* (development, architectural design, and related technical services.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. COMPENSATION AND BENEFITS) Tj
T* (Employer agrees to pay Employee a fixed monthly compensation of ₹40,000 \(Forty) Tj
T* (Thousand Indian Rupees\), payable on the last business day of each calendar month) Tj
T* (via direct electronic bank transfer, subject to applicable statutory tax) Tj
T* (deductions.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (3. TERM AND TERMINATION) Tj
T* (The initial term of this Agreement shall commence on November 1, 2024. Either) Tj
T* (party may terminate this employment relationship without cause by providing at) Tj
T* (least thirty \(30\) days prior written notice to the other party. Employer) Tj
T* (reserves the right to terminate immediately for cause involving gross misconduct) Tj
T* (or material breach.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (4. CONFIDENTIALITY OBLIGATIONS) Tj
T* (Employee acknowledges that during employment, Employee will have access to) Tj
T* (proprietary software codebases, trade secrets, business strategies, and client) Tj
T* (data. Employee agrees to preserve the strict confidentiality of all proprietary) Tj
T* (information during employment and for a period of two \(2\) years following) Tj
T* (termination of employment.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (5. RESTRICTIVE COVENANTS \(POST-TERMINATION NON-COMPETE\)) Tj
T* (To protect Employer's legitimate business interests, Employee covenants that for) Tj
T* (a period of three \(3\) months following the effective date of termination,) Tj
T* (Employee shall not directly or indirectly accept employment with, consult for,) Tj
T* (or provide competing software engineering services to direct commercial) Tj
T* (competitors in the same geographic territory.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (6. DISPUTE RESOLUTION AND ARBITRATION) Tj
T* (Any dispute, claim, or controversy arising out of or relating to this Agreement,) Tj
T* (its interpretation, or its termination shall be submitted to and resolved by) Tj
T* (binding confidential arbitration administered in accordance with standard) Tj
T* (arbitration rules before a single neutral arbitrator in Bangalore. The) Tj
T* (arbitrator's award shall be final, non-appealable, and binding on both parties.) Tj
T* () Tj
